              "content": "This method retrieves the details for an eBay event. The result set contains detailed information associated with the specified event ID, such as applicable coupons, start and end dates, and event terms.<h3><b>Restrictions </b></h3>This method can return a maximum of 10,000 items. For a list of supported sites and other restrictions, see <a href=\"/api-docs/buy/browse/overview.html#API\" target=\"_blank\">API Restrictions</a>.<br><br><span class=\"tablenote\"><b>eBay Partner Network: </b> In order to receive a commission for your sales, you must use the URL returned in the <code>itemAffiliateWebUrl</code> field to forward your buyer to the ebay.com site. </span>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
